{"id":"3812e440af103029","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-locally-constant-sheaves-covering-equivalence.md","title":"Theorem II.6 Locally Constant Sheaves and Covering Spaces","display":"Theorem II.6 Locally Constant Sheaves and Covering Spaces","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-locally-constant-sheaves-covering-equivalence","aliases":["14-thm-locally-constant-sheaves-covering-equivalence"],"display":"Theorem II.6 Locally Constant Sheaves and Covering Spaces","depends_on":["[[14-df-covering-spaces-and-locally-constant-sheaves]]","[[14-thm-etale-bundle-recovery]]","[[14-df-constant-sheaves]]","[[14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves]]"],"source_location":"II Exercise 5 and 7, printed 104; DjVu 58; local-triviality variant with proof in note","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-locally-constant-sheaves-covering-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-locally-constant-sheaves-covering-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem II.6 Locally Constant Sheaves and Covering Spaces"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ead2b5b1b3a20ecd\" href=\"?note=ead2b5b1b3a20ecd\" title=\"14-df-covering-spaces-and-locally-constant-sheaves\">14-df-covering-spaces-and-locally-constant-sheaves</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"136d21829e234687\" href=\"?note=136d21829e234687\" title=\"14-thm-etale-bundle-recovery\">14-thm-etale-bundle-recovery</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"24c837c0a0986f5c\" href=\"?note=24c837c0a0986f5c\" title=\"14-df-constant-sheaves\">14-df-constant-sheaves</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9607e7b53e4ed265\" href=\"?note=9607e7b53e4ed265\" title=\"14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves\">14-df-restrictions-and-separated-presheaves</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"II Exercise 5 and 7, printed 104; DjVu 58; local-triviality variant with proof in note"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；空间载体、截面值与指标集均取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>，有关范畴和函子集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 上的层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_XF=(E_F,\\sigma_F,p_F)\">\\(\\Lambda_XF=(E_F,\\sigma_F,p_F)\\)</span>；LocConst、Cover 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ead2b5b1b3a20ecd\" href=\"?note=ead2b5b1b3a20ecd\" title=\"14-df-covering-spaces-and-locally-constant-sheaves\">14-df-covering-spaces-and-locally-constant-sheaves</a> 的精确定义。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cover}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cover}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ead2b5b1b3a20ecd\" href=\"?note=ead2b5b1b3a20ecd\" title=\"14-df-covering-spaces-and-locally-constant-sheaves\">14-df-covering-spaces-and-locally-constant-sheaves</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LocConst}\">\\(\\mathrm{LocConst}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ead2b5b1b3a20ecd\" href=\"?note=ead2b5b1b3a20ecd\" title=\"14-df-covering-spaces-and-locally-constant-sheaves\">14-df-covering-spaces-and-locally-constant-sheaves</a> 中的精确签名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LocConst}(F)\\iff\\mathrm{Cover}(p_F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LocConst}(F)\\iff\\mathrm{Cover}(p_F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F|_U\\cong\\Delta_UA\">\\(F|_U\\cong\\Delta_UA\\)</span>，茎空间在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 上同胚于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\times A\">\\(U\\times A\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 离散）。切片 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\times\\{a\\}\">\\(U\\times\\{a\\}\\)</span> 给出等覆盖邻域。反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_F^{-1}U\">\\(p_F^{-1}U\\)</span> 分解为各自同胚到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 的开切片 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(W_i)\">\\((W_i)\\)</span>，其并同胚于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\times I\">\\(U\\times I\\)</span>；取截面层再用层与 étale 空间恢复同构，即得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F|_U\\cong\\Delta_UI\">\\(F|_U\\cong\\Delta_UI\\)</span>。本证明不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 连通，也不诉诸原书邻域基版本，适用于所声明的一般拓扑空间。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-covering-spaces-and-locally-constant-sheaves","status":"resolved","id":"ead2b5b1b3a20ecd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-covering-spaces-and-locally-constant-sheaves]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-etale-bundle-recovery","status":"resolved","id":"136d21829e234687","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-etale-bundle-recovery]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-constant-sheaves","status":"re